url: "https://github.com/tstenborg/latex-styling-ggplot2"
abstract: >-
  "This repository holds digital resources associated with the article \
  'Styling R ggplot2 graphics with LaTeX'. ggplot2 is a popular graphics \
  package used with the R statistical programming language. That article \
  demonstrates supplementing ggplot2's native styling options with LaTeX. \
  Applying Greek letters, italicised text and subscripts to a scatterplot, \
  was used an illustrative example."
keywords:
  - ggplot2
  - latex
  - r
